452
00:29:27,640 --> 00:29:32,120
at Carvel on Ainsworth Avenue all those years ago.

453
00:29:32,120 --> 00:29:37,200
Augie, I have a friend I want you to meet,, okay?”? she said.. “He’s coming over

454
00:29:37,200 --> 00:29:38,800
in a few minutes.”.

455
00:29:38,800 --> 00:29:41,280
“Is he your new boyfriend?

456
00:29:41,280 --> 00:29:42,760
August teased..

457
00:29:42,760 --> 00:29:44,840
Via kicked the bottom of his chair..

458
00:29:44,840 --> 00:29:49,000
“Just be nice,”, she said, and left the room..

459
00:29:49,000 --> 00:29:52,680
“Dude,, your sister’s hot,”, I said..

460
00:29:52,680 --> 00:29:55,400
“I know.”.

461
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:59,600
“She hates me,, right?? You told her about the Halloween Incident?”.

462
00:29:59,600 --> 00:30:01,120
“Yeah.”.

463
00:30:01,120 --> 00:30:05,720
“Yeah,, she hates me or yeah,, you told her about Halloween?”.

464
00:30:05,720 --> 00:30:08,120
“Both.

465
00:30:08,120 --> 00:30:10,080
The boyfriend.

466
00:30:10,080 --> 00:30:14,280
TWO MINUTES LATER the sister came back with this guy named Justin..

467
00:30:14,280 --> 00:30:19,360
Seemed like a cool enough dude.. Longish hair., Little round glasses..

468
00:30:19,360 --> 00:30:24,920
He was carrying a big long shiny silver case that ended in a sharp point on one end..

469
00:30:24,920 --> 00:30:29,400
“Justin,, this is my little brother, August,”, said Via..

470
00:30:29,400 --> 00:30:31,360
“And that’s Jack.”.

471
00:30:31,360 --> 00:30:34,800
“Hey, guys,”, said Justin, shaking our hands..

472
00:30:34,800 --> 00:30:36,760
He seemed a little nervous..

473
00:30:36,760 --> 00:30:40,920
I guess maybe it was because he was meeting August for the first time..

474
00:30:40,920 --> 00:30:44,880
Sometimes I forget what a shock it is the first time you meet him..

475
00:30:44,880 --> 00:30:46,560
“Cool room.”.

476
00:30:46,560 --> 00:30:48,600
“Are you Via’s boyfriend?”?

477
00:30:48,600 --> 00:30:53,640
Auggie asked mischievously,, and his sister pulled his cap down over his face..

478
00:30:53,640 --> 00:30:56,760
“What’s in your case?”? I said., "“A machine gun?"

479
00:30:56,760 --> 00:31:04,160
Huh? answered the boyfriend.. “That’s funny.. No,, it’s a fiddle.”.

480
00:31:04,160 --> 00:31:06,880
“Justin’s a fiddler,”, said Via..

481
00:31:06,880 --> 00:31:09,280
“He’s in a zydeco band.”.

482
00:31:09,280 --> 00:31:14,840
“What the heck is a zydeco band?”? said Auggie, looking at me..

483
00:31:14,840 --> 00:31:20,040
“It’s a type of music,”, said Justin.. “Like Creole music.”.

484
00:31:20,040 --> 00:31:23,120
“What’s Creole?”? I said..

485
00:31:23,120 --> 00:31:26,760
“You should tell people that’s a machine gun,”, said Auggie..

486
00:31:26,760 --> 00:31:28,840
“Nobody would ever mess with you.

487
00:31:28,840 --> 00:31:35,000
Huh, I guess you’re right,”, Justin said,, nodding and tucking his hair behind his ears..

488
00:31:35,000 --> 00:31:40,280
“Creole’s the kind of music they play in Louisiana,”, he said to me..

489
00:31:40,280 --> 00:31:47,680
“Are you from Louisiana?”? I asked.. “No,, um,”, he answered, pushing up his glasses..

490
00:31:47,680 --> 00:31:49,360
“I’m from Brooklyn.”.

491
00:31:49,360 --> 00:31:52,560
I don’t know why this made me want to laugh..

492
00:31:52,560 --> 00:31:56,440
“Come on, Justin,”, said Via,, pulling him by the hand..

493
00:31:56,440 --> 00:31:59,160
“Let’s go hang out in my room.”.

494
00:31:59,160 --> 00:32:00,280
“Okay,.

495
00:32:00,280 --> 00:32:04,240
see you guys later.. Bye,”. he said..

496
00:32:04,240 --> 00:32:06,840
“Bye!”. “Bye!”.

497
00:32:06,840 --> 00:32:10,800
As soon as they left the room,, Auggie looked at me, smiling..

498
00:32:10,800 --> 00:32:17,040
“I’m from Brooklyn,”, I said,, and we both started laughing hysterically.

499
00:32:17,040 --> 00:32:18,600
Thanks for listening.

500
00:32:18,600 --> 00:32:23,280
Please remember to like and subscribe, become a channel member, and we'll see

501
00:32:23,280 --> 00:32:26,560
you in the next video.
